WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.069
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.070
We hope you're all
doing well tonight

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.805
and, now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.841
According to new reports,
the House Select Committee

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.710
investigating the January
attack on the Capitol

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:13.279
is planning to increase efforts

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:15.481
to force former Trump advisor
Steve Bannon

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.149
to comply with subpoenas.

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:18.617
Well, just a thought, but,

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.454
have you tried playing
some yacht rock?

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:23.889
[ Laughter ]
If Bannon hears
Michael McDonald,

00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:25.791
he'll probably just float
into the courtroom

00:00:25.791 --> 00:00:28.595
like when a cartoon dog
smells a pie cooking.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.630
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.732
In a new statement,
former President Trump said,

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.000
"If we don't solve

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.502
the presidential election
fraud of 2020,

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:39.773
Republicans will not be
voting in '22 or '24."

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.708
Wow, he's been
out of office so long,

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.676
he's forgotten how threats work.

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.144
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:46.813
"If I'm not invited
to your party,

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.848
then neither is
my karaoke machine.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.417
Still no?"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.319
That's right,
Trump is urging Republicans

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.020
not to vote
in the midterm elections,

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:58.758
unless the "fraud" of the
elections is uncovered.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:01.994
But, for some reason, the
thought of only Democrats voting

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:03.530
still isn't reassuring to me.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.964
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.765
Arizona Senator Kyrsten Sinema

00:01:06.765 --> 00:01:09.636
is reportedly on a fundraising
trip this week to Europe.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:11.804
She's bopping around Europe now?

00:01:11.804 --> 00:01:14.473
Arizona, did you elect her
or divorce her?

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:16.509
[ Laughter ]
Now, on top of everything else,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.811
she's going to come back
with a fake accent.

00:01:18.811 --> 00:01:21.814
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.814 --> 00:01:22.982
[ Posh English accent ]
I will not vote for this bill,

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.183
as presently appointed.

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:26.085
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:29.088
The NHL announced yesterday
that 99% of its players

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.590
have received
the coronavirus vaccine.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.859
I guess they figure
the side effects of the shot

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:34.993
can't be worse than the
side effects of hockey.

00:01:34.993 --> 00:01:36.729
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:40.066
That's right, the NHL says
that all but four players

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:41.968
have received
the coronavirus vaccine

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:45.004
and, needless to say,
all but one mascot.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.873
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:48.775
He's doing his own research.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:51.777
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:54.346
A hairdresser from Indiana
was sentenced this week

00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:55.848
[ Laughter ]
to 14 days in jail

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:57.683
and 60 hours
of community service

00:01:57.683 --> 00:02:00.720
for participating in the January
attack on the Capitol.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.556
And I'm guessing, if she's
a hairdresser in Indiana,

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.991
she's guilty
of even more heinous crimes.

00:02:05.991 --> 00:02:07.227
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:07.227 --> 00:02:09.028
If everything is highlights,

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.697
then nothing is highlights!

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:14.967
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.967 --> 00:02:18.438
That's tonight's sassiest joke.

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:20.907
That's the feeling of sassiness.

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:22.242
The White House
announced yesterday

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.244
that Walmart, FedEx, and UPS

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:26.812
will increase operations
and begin working 24/7

00:02:26.812 --> 00:02:29.281
to address the global
supply chain bottlenecks.

00:02:29.281 --> 00:02:32.118
While Amazon is still, somehow,
able to deliver you

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:34.854
a gnome riding a corgi
within 24 hours.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.624
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:39.859
The CEO of IKEA said,
in a new interview,

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:42.762
that he expects supply chain
issues and product shortages

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:44.363
to last well into next year.

00:02:44.363 --> 00:02:46.031
In fact, things have
gotten so bad

00:02:46.031 --> 00:02:48.501
that the company has completely
run out of umlauts.

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.637
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:51.938
[ As Johnny Carson ]
Did you hear that, Ed?

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:53.339
They ran out of --

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:54.340
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.475
Ran out of umlauts.

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:57.043
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.277 --> 00:03:03.649
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:05.718
I try to bomb bad enough

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:07.320
that I can still hear
the crew laugh.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.789
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.090
"There they are."

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:13.125
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:15.461
The Port Authority
of New York and New Jersey

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:17.763
announced this week that it
will pause further action

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:19.131
on the LaGuardia air train

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:21.300
because the only thing worse
than going to LaGuardia

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.735
is getting there sooner.

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.771
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.606
And, finally,
according to new reports,

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:29.609
some areas of the country are
experiencing a pumpkin shortage,

00:03:29.609 --> 00:03:31.777
which is why Starbucks
has introduced

00:03:31.777 --> 00:03:33.546
its new zucchini spice latte.

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:34.747
[ Laughter and applause ]
That

00:03:34.747 --> 00:03:36.583
was the monologue, everybody.

